 and key-presses to the remote computer, and replicating the remote computer's display (subject to differences in resolution) locally in real time.\nUltraVNC bears a strong resemblance to RealVNC Free Edition.\nHowever, in addition to remote control it adds various features, such as an encryption plugin to secure the client/server connection.\nIt also supports file transfers, chat functionality and various authentication methods.\nThe two computers must be able to communicate across a network, such as a local subnet, internal network, or the Internet.","moniker":"ultravnc","name":"UltraVnc","packageUrl":"https://www.uvnc.com/downloads/ultravnc.html","publisher":"uvnc bvba","publisherUrl":"https://www.uvnc.com","tags":["remote-desktop","vnc"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.uvnc.com","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/u/uvncbvba/UltraVNC/1.4.2.0/uvncbvba.UltraVNC.yaml","sha256":"aa2380fbd4a41643f6109e7bab2478d103a9e0a8039583d5be3df850e087f0be"},{"path":"manifests/u/uvncbvba/UltraVNC/1.4.2.0/uvncbvba.UltraVNC.installer.yaml","sha256":"edaeda7c770265bae2706a3012ad2c1f2b6055b5cd720a01c580aa0572da6756"},{"path":"manifests/u/uvncbvba/UltraVNC/1.4.2.0/uvncbvba.UltraVNC.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"23a58ae3b2380bcb172c7eb118577cd5bdee6e59ed8fa392bf6bedf61c8ba355"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.4.2.0"}